WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:08.133
It's always been this way with her.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:12.512
The more I get, the happier
I am, the more resentful she becomes. Mom.

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:15.724
Take a deep breath.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.892
I'm just so sorry
you even had to witness that

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:20.228
Auntie Vy,

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:23.523
said a lot of hurtful
things. Awful things.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.192
Have you ever stopped to ask yourself why?

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.820
Maybe underneath all of that

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.071
Anger.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:33.825
She's just hurt?
What? Vy has made of steel.

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:35.994
Vy put myself through college, 

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:39.122
Vy raised Will on her own, Vy--

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:42.959
took care of mom on her own.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.715
She's just been doing everything.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:50.091
Yeah.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:56.389
That's just--

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:00.727
a heavy expectation to put on someone,
don't you think?

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:05.231
I've been doing this to her whole life.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:13.740
Mom, I think that you and your sister
need to have a talk.

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:16.451
You know, without all the insults.

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.078
Of course.

00:01:22.665 --> 00:01:24.584
So when did you get so wise?

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:28.379
I think it was the 100th time
you told me to make it work with Will.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:32.092
Because we're family.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:54.948
I didn't mean to ruin your party
like that.

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:58.409
I really didn’t.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:01:59.661
Mom.

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:02.622
You do know that there's no way in hell

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:07.168
anyone could ever rid you from my life.
Ever. 

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:10.505
Thank you, baby.

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:16.928
You know, in my mind,
I had planned this wonderful trip

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:22.851
to celebrate your birthday,
and your aunt Viv just got under my skin.

00:02:23.226 --> 00:02:24.769
Look, I love you, Mom,

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:26.437
but you can't put that all on Viv,

00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:29.732
because you were throwin some low blows in
there too. I was only trying to defend myself.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.153
You know, she crossed the line first and

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:35.363
so what?

00:02:35.613 --> 00:02:37.490
You're here waiting for an apology.

00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:44.247
I guess this is the part where you tell me
I should be the bigger person.

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:46.416
I mean,

00:02:46.624 --> 00:02:49.419
it's good advice.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:54.215
Will, do you mind if I speak to my sister

00:02:54.215 --> 00:02:57.594
alone for a moment?

00:02:59.929 --> 00:03:00.763
Make me proud.

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.062
You're right.

00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:14.819
I haven't always acknowledged
how much I received.

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:17.280
And relied on your mother.

00:03:19.616 --> 00:03:21.326
I've been unfair to both of you.

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:23.203
I mean,

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:27.332
you're always the strong one
looking out for me.

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:32.503
I’m so sorry for seeing past that. 

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:38.218
Can you ever forgive me?

00:03:40.511 --> 00:03:41.679
Yes, of course.

00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:44.349
You're my sister.

00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:48.061
Besides,
I can't pin all my disappointments on you.

00:03:49.437 --> 00:03:50.730
I made my choices.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:53.024
And one of them was Lou.

00:03:53.816 --> 00:03:55.693
I'm sorry I didn't listen to you.

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:57.111
I'm sorry that

00:03:57.987 --> 00:04:01.616
I held it against you all these years.

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:05.662
You were right about him.

00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:08.581
Believe me, I wish I wasn't. 

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:10.458
Me too.

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:14.170
But he did give me a gift

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:18.424
that I'll always be thankful for.

00:04:18.508 --> 00:04:19.175
Will.

00:04:20.218 --> 00:04:22.178
He is so special.

00:04:22.178 --> 00:04:23.179
Yeah,

00:04:24.013 --> 00:04:27.100
He's a fine young man.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:32.230
That is why I've decided
not to do anything to tamper with that.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:37.318
So were gonna wait to tell him about Lou?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.029
Yeah, Maybe down the road.

00:04:45.201 --> 00:04:46.119
I love you. 

00:04:46.244 --> 00:04:46.953
Viv.

00:04:49.163 --> 00:04:50.665
I know.

00:04:53.376 --> 00:04:54.377
Girl, I love you, too.

00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:55.920
Come on.

